From df3e3a98c07d784165479ccc6102077eee324930 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: chiffathefox <chiffathefoxx@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 25 Jul 2026 03:36:44 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 36/46] clk: exynos9820: add BUSC block

These clocks probably will never be used by any consumers and can be left out. The main point of this block is to match the DRCG_EN and MEMCLK downstream register values for this block

(cherry picked from commit 437e380afe191bca3661095b58346116964b29a5)
